cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use this software or repository in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "Explainable E-Commerce Personalization System"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-26"

authors:
  - family-names: "Ghahreman"
    given-names: "Parisa"

abstract: >
  An explainable e-commerce personalization framework that combines
  leakage-aware cart-to-purchase prediction, SHAP explainability,
  behavior-based item-to-item recommendation, probability-based action
  policies, temporal evaluation, and external validation on YooChoose.

keywords:
  - e-commerce
  - recommender systems
  - explainable AI
  - machine learning
  - CatBoost
  - SHAP
  - personalization
  - cart-to-purchase prediction
  - external validation

license: MIT

